      "uid": "zhcn:d1b8de60400cf5fc6679057e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怎、怎么办呀……。\n要是搜索『神业』的话……哇哇哇哇……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bc6357cf9dce618eeff8b0047095ebb2a8d644bff93c69b5b75a436672d292a",
