    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78d0daf35c28d4f2b6066cef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来神业大受打击的样子。\n我一边轻抚她的后背\n一边思考着今后的打算。",
      "source_fingerprint": "499a9bcf14724342c1b43b677df5b2a0528e82195b716ea5fb38fdda70ac6138",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        57,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/57/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55d9f36460f7584860cb7c66",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……她所追求的，是有趣的比赛。\n并不仅仅以胜利为目的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11f1f871f6ab6acd547d0374bf0370447f0ebd1eaca055c688e0cf376324c300",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        58,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/58/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e05a02c11cf611cf753b46dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是即便她试图描绘出趣味，\n现在的她也无法构筑那样的画面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5289b147c68f90aa7a5629e9ac51df487d591d195d2998be3ae7e3b0093d8085",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2930b76f1e9fb915ada14ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摄影师",
      "source_fingerprint": "66eedcb516e36163dff5c6644705763134b6a8e82e929416e3b64fa116bcc784",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03509b75f6461e1c9b075c6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "影像也完美地拍好了。\n待会儿过去谈谈，\n也上传到我们的马管上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "585703f67280ff697d7b5f114b86329ddcd21e0749740526741bcbbe18b65fa6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ca2c4829ca1b6985c449ddd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "先休息一下怎么样?",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7f197f0e9c90cd3cbccfb0056726dfdbfd9d5c6c39b78b776eb40caed60ad7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26c5882d1058be18ce1a2e2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……如果继续像这次这样迷失方向\n恐怕在找到解决的头绪之前，\n她的心就先枯萎了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d791d9c84781a36daee5b137be8ea04aa55348b8630f95b572fceb08e476e80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137114.json",
      "json_path": [
