    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87f77d729618396700661732",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………嚯……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ead55e60ce5f95ae7b6e5966ad32dbfd3fe3c3991079fdba5c0fee9d66102dd8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6197c5fae9cddcc473182614",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "未能与神业充分沟通导致这样的结果，\n我也难逃其责。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b38e828f58e8c233bcb51256b8fd778e4a56fca168a0acb6352dd4b2da6f9f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f69daca70dadd46edc83cb1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……说到底、\n为神业的胜利沾沾自喜的正是我自己。\n我过于为她的胜利感到高兴了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abbc2437231358316f61cb18f732f10bafaf0bbd594add3da02d5c98ca01aac8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137114.json",
      "json_path": [
