      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对神业来说，\n创造出『有趣的比赛』与胜利同样重要。\n――这一点我不该忘记的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29ca03db9be3eb4eedae8c3aad0db31f014c42f729489ab8a22689192d158f43",
